L154: **PROJECT PLAN**
L155: TRAINING DURING PREGNANCY
L156:  - **Effects of regular exercise during pregnancy in prevention of**
L157: **pregnancy-related diseases and complications during labour**
L158: A randomised clinical trial
L159: Signe Stafne Western
L160: PhD-student
L161: Dept of Community Medicine and General Practice, Norwegian University of Science and
L162: Technology, Trondheim, Norway
L163: Siv Mørkved
L164: PT, MSc, PhD
L165: Senior Researcher Clinical Service, Hospital, Trondheim
